Ha ha

529
00:14:42,286 --> 00:14:42,924
(Nom)

530
00:14:42,925 --> 00:14:44,725
Ten thousand, twenty thousand,
thirty thousand won

531
00:14:44,725 --> 00:14:46,060
Three, four

532
00:14:46,060 --> 00:14:48,162
Sixty-two thousand five hundred won

533
00:14:48,163 --> 00:14:48,963
(Steakhouse payout
Total: 62,500 won)
How many hours?

534
00:14:48,963 --> 00:14:49,864
Five hours

535
00:14:49,864 --> 00:14:51,599
- So that’s ten thousand won per hour
- Whoa

536
00:14:51,599 --> 00:14:54,135
So we’re actually getting
a bit more than ten thousand won

537
00:14:54,135 --> 00:14:54,468
Whoa

538
00:14:54,468 --> 00:14:56,270
You’re quick at calculating
this kind of thing, right?

539
00:14:56,272 --> 00:14:57,604
(Shiver)
Whoa

540
00:14:57,605 --> 00:14:58,338
Give me your hand

541
00:14:58,340 --> 00:14:59,172
Okay, okay, okay

542
00:14:59,172 --> 00:15:01,308
Out of five points

543
00:15:01,308 --> 00:15:02,442
Hmm

544
00:15:02,442 --> 00:15:03,977
Hmm...

545
00:15:03,977 --> 00:15:04,645
3.5 points

546
00:15:04,645 --> 00:15:05,879
Oh, oh wow, wait a second

547
00:15:05,879 --> 00:15:08,916
(Steakhouse job satisfaction
Fun meeting customers 5.0
That feeling

548
00:15:08,916 --> 00:15:11,618
Strict atmosphere 3.0
Freezer smell 3.0)
when you get to congratulate customers,

549
00:15:11,619 --> 00:15:12,586
see couples, feel proud

550
00:15:12,587 --> 00:15:13,287
That was fun

551
00:15:13,288 --> 00:15:13,787
Yeah

552
00:15:13,787 --> 00:15:16,256
I think that's the kind of happiness
that keeps me going

553
00:15:16,256 --> 00:15:18,358
And then out in the hall,
it gets pretty intense

554
00:15:18,358 --> 00:15:19,526
Boss

555
00:15:19,526 --> 00:15:20,394
The captains are so

556
00:15:20,394 --> 00:15:20,894
Chef

557
00:15:20,894 --> 00:15:23,163
- It was a bit scary
- Yeah,

558
00:15:23,163 --> 00:15:25,165
understandable

559
00:15:25,165 --> 00:15:25,999
Mhm

560
00:15:25,999 --> 00:15:27,935
Today was my first Workdol,

561
00:15:27,935 --> 00:15:30,771
and I had such a great time
because it left such a strong impression

562
00:15:30,771 --> 00:15:33,941
My rating is also 3.5 stars,
just like Asa unnie

563
00:15:33,944 --> 00:15:37,178
(Steakhouse work satisfaction
Kitchen is a bit scary 3.0
Honestly, the kitchen is really scary

564
00:15:37,179 --> 00:15:37,678
True

565
00:15:37,678 --> 00:15:41,682
Introvert issue 3.0
Fun meeting customers 5.0)
So I think it might tough for introverted people

566
00:15:44,385 --> 00:15:46,452
(Today’s ending pose?)
Since we’re at a fancy restaurant,

567
00:15:46,452 --> 00:15:48,189
let’s sing “Rich Man” once,

568
00:15:48,189 --> 00:15:50,992
so we can become

569
00:15:50,992 --> 00:15:52,760
rich ourselves someday

570
00:15:52,760 --> 00:15:54,629
I am a Rich Man

571
00:15:54,629 --> 00:15:57,131
(Chilling concert in the freezer warehouse)

572
00:15:57,131 --> 00:15:58,666
I am a Rich Man

573
00:15:58,666 --> 00:16:00,501
But our new song is coming out soon

574
00:16:00,501 --> 00:16:04,705
(Please check out “We Go Up” too!)

575
00:16:06,707 --> 00:16:08,842
(Q. Ever been confessed with a letter?)
Asa, have you ever gotten a love letter?

576
00:16:08,843 --> 00:16:10,678
Oh, plenty of times

577
00:16:10,678 --> 00:16:12,646
Actually, I have a story about that

578
00:16:12,646 --> 00:16:15,049
(A little trip down memory lane)
It was the last day of school,

579
00:16:15,049 --> 00:16:16,517
and I found a confession letter

580
00:16:16,517 --> 00:16:17,651
inside my shoe

581
00:16:17,651 --> 00:16:18,752
Stop it

582
00:16:18,752 --> 00:16:20,154
Are you even listening to my story?

583
00:16:20,154 --> 00:16:21,855
(Bored)
Oh, I’ve heard that so many times

584
00:16:21,855 --> 00:16:24,592
But I saw that in Korea,

585
00:16:24,593 --> 00:16:26,160
so I never actually met him

586
00:16:26,160 --> 00:16:28,062
(Summary)
So the shoes with the letter inside

587
00:16:28,062 --> 00:16:28,896
came straight to Korea just like that

588
00:16:28,896 --> 00:16:29,330
True

589
00:16:29,330 --> 00:16:30,197
I was just dancing,

590
00:16:30,197 --> 00:16:31,198
and suddenly, huh?

591
00:16:31,200 --> 00:16:32,366
Is there something in my shoe?

592
00:16:32,366 --> 00:16:33,467
I took it out to look,

593
00:16:33,468 --> 00:16:34,001
and there was

594
00:16:34,001 --> 00:16:34,768
(A letter)
a letter inside

595
00:16:34,768 --> 00:16:35,469
So

596
00:16:35,469 --> 00:16:37,571
(That's enough now)

